{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:15:05Z","created_by_operation":"op_45e1a35b2c434ef6bdf7aad6bc3cd4d0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_156b4340fb2c227cf29b9282859dd38d5d47228a26ea6ffc925cbbac29893b9d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"patilshreyas/debroid@90139a0c1ab5 snapshot a2e8fba98b8e8276","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_38bfb2e5249ad76153de5812340cb591a54a566f27f95568dbbf173eca9b2785"],"source_ids":["src_bac38073475d5caba93a0c36a4e699fb"],"text":"The daemon listens on localhost (127.0.0.1) without authentication for fast CLI communication, and the README warns it exposes live JVM manipulation and should only run on fully trusted machines.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:15:05Z","updated_by_operation":"op_45e1a35b2c434ef6bdf7aad6bc3cd4d0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:15:05Z","created_by_operation":"op_45e1a35b2c434ef6bdf7aad6bc3cd4d0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_19cdc0975ad04bf45b0f2a5d56a5680636788e4ea301aa036d6619b2a4d95d3d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"patilshreyas/debroid@90139a0c1ab5 snapshot a2e8fba98b8e8276","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9f0ab2587880d3f66aa50b21e9b9bcd87940ad7c9bceae2ddf1e7e23be11356c"],"source_ids":["src_bac38073475d5caba93a0c36a4e699fb"],"text":"Debroid is a headless CLI speaking the Java Debug Wire Protocol (JDWP) so AI agents can debug live Android apps via machine-parseable JSON without a GUI.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:15:05Z","updated_by_operation":"op_45e1a35b2c434ef6bdf7aad6bc3cd4d0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:15:05Z","created_by_operation":"op_45e1a35b2c434ef6bdf7aad6bc3cd4d0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_478ff84156000bcac64e29f8bb9cbd1e51dce4ea4fc4361bc70799b83dbcd7f9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"patilshreyas/debroid@90139a0c1ab5 snapshot a2e8fba98b8e8276","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_035c20366e9f954f44db48ee7f65b02bb2d3654e3e1608aa094e44c354f3fb4c"],"source_ids":["src_bac38073475d5caba93a0c36a4e699fb"],"text":"CLI commands forward requests to a background daemon that auto-starts on first command, holds a long-lived JDWP socket via ADB port forwarding, and returns strict JSON on stdout.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:15:05Z","updated_by_operation":"op_45e1a35b2c434ef6bdf7aad6bc3cd4d0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:15:05Z","created_by_operation":"op_45e1a35b2c434ef6bdf7aad6bc3cd4d0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4bfee066c64a4b4e972506915a446bb831af56b8f2b1ff50d0676011568ec1e3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"patilshreyas/debroid@90139a0c1ab5 snapshot a2e8fba98b8e8276","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6e48a63b618fe0a8009ef9bf2364cbfff4b343b8f1e3b2b5da96003bea7d121b"],"source_ids":["src_11fb91b4ebbd535689d9a5d9970ed66a"],"text":"The in-memory event buffer was increased to 10,000 events, and poll output includes droppedEventsSinceLastPoll to signal unnotified event loss under high volume.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:15:05Z","updated_by_operation":"op_45e1a35b2c434ef6bdf7aad6bc3cd4d0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:15:05Z","created_by_operation":"op_45e1a35b2c434ef6bdf7aad6bc3cd4d0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5d3c9cb689405016814fcce7f9d94382c350e36570d0ca03bbbcf872ae255fc6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"patilshreyas/debroid@90139a0c1ab5 snapshot a2e8fba98b8e8276","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3124ad458fab02678963cd90a7ed2008834aa1674e42b7644a27229688bb4687"],"source_ids":["src_11fb91b4ebbd535689d9a5d9970ed66a"],"text":"JSON serialization omits null fields (explicitNulls = false) to shrink payloads and save context tokens for AI agents.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:15:05Z","updated_by_operation":"op_45e1a35b2c434ef6bdf7aad6bc3cd4d0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:15:05Z","created_by_operation":"op_45e1a35b2c434ef6bdf7aad6bc3cd4d0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_750def0d7eee7e9b09a4a97abeef2f2436d351a9d363b8099045acfa4aa2ee49","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"patilshreyas/debroid@90139a0c1ab5 snapshot a2e8fba98b8e8276","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7da3cadda72cb342af0181605b7ef75fbc416c5155d60233148a7ac52e4aa625"],"source_ids":["src_bac38073475d5caba93a0c36a4e699fb"],"text":"Features include recursive deep object inspection with cycle-guards, live variable mutation via set-var, expression evaluation in the target VM, and extraction of shallow locals from Kotlin Continuation frames.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:15:05Z","updated_by_operation":"op_45e1a35b2c434ef6bdf7aad6bc3cd4d0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:15:05Z","created_by_operation":"op_45e1a35b2c434ef6bdf7aad6bc3cd4d0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9271ae6cd91a98ffb73c4b60cafeec033cdc6413914839cf1a1869f1210356dd","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"patilshreyas/debroid@90139a0c1ab5 snapshot a2e8fba98b8e8276","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0ef2af735655319fb28138e434365ebe08ffa204ad206453ee2eac08c403f8ac","slc_6fb3e351fc3a89a3031cdaee3640e3d67b49d633e7bb604dab4a5fa8c5909da6","slc_814ad722946adc2b94e68cafda5a817e8b8442adfc86d5b5bef2876d5bd00d32","slc_9b5ce2a680685762c2d30a411bf364fe3f1bba07096d2057cd5f918aca08f0ff"],"source_ids":["src_6426cfc9c9f35f0b8c4c06672371ac9a"],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors must run ./gradlew detekt test :cli:build for fast verification and ./gradlew build before final commits, and must never use raw println in the CLI layer—only serialized JSON via kotlinx.serialization.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:15:05Z","updated_by_operation":"op_45e1a35b2c434ef6bdf7aad6bc3cd4d0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:15:05Z","created_by_operation":"op_45e1a35b2c434ef6bdf7aad6bc3cd4d0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_99542f5b662d255ad217bcd9c6cf245fcd7179b5accf9d3b9aa7efd5258e1e98","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"patilshreyas/debroid@90139a0c1ab5 snapshot a2e8fba98b8e8276","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2d8ec478b001546fdd275f899d79ec75677f15c48b60207430e88aedac4bdb97","slc_4dc0b372cbae43fbfc7e3a312e3c014647b29882efa4250be107a6749b00a370","slc_74dbb9d5cbf5cc4041ff6158274bead059e2d8e56bb828ee792025bce2523df1","slc_a0fe2e85b2370e8559855a79e845af921323d8b972295684fe2f3c53099970ce"],"source_ids":["src_6426cfc9c9f35f0b8c4c06672371ac9a"],"text":"Repository development practice: CLI JSON response models are guarded by golden schema tests in JsonSchemaGoldenTest; contributors update schemas with ./gradlew test -DupdateGoldenSchemas=true and must keep SKILL.md, README command reference, and CHANGELOG.md in sync with any command or output change.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:15:05Z","updated_by_operation":"op_45e1a35b2c434ef6bdf7aad6bc3cd4d0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:15:05Z","created_by_operation":"op_45e1a35b2c434ef6bdf7aad6bc3cd4d0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a9ccbf50058029674d93079001b417d066b2a66acff1c18e605c7f2244095e9c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"patilshreyas/debroid@90139a0c1ab5 snapshot a2e8fba98b8e8276","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2096ee8e159f7d03805d9e4b3a816007524e0936a1276870af3a8600f9439c4f","slc_3cfe0bdebee0b43ba4342268ce2e1c054ee37cb7b93e4b64f2e9ff87f536d586","slc_bb4965b0fcd61ddb68789043e18be18276236a987f1932186313a5fabec46c19","slc_f39e8ec7418f964386901ef599e06f95775c3257e3778b337a42e564076a7f4e"],"source_ids":["src_bac38073475d5caba93a0c36a4e699fb"],"text":"The CLI auto-extracts AI skill instructions to ~/.debroid/skills/debroid-cli/SKILL.md on first run, and the README documents symlink setup for agents like Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, and OpenCode.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:15:05Z","updated_by_operation":"op_45e1a35b2c434ef6bdf7aad6bc3cd4d0"}
